+### B. Pre-Answer Ritual
+
+Before providing any answer about OpenRouter:
+
+1. **Refresh docs index**: `curl -sS https://openrouter.ai/docs/llms.txt`
+2. **Fetch models list**: `curl -sS https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/models` if models, capabilities, or pricing are relevant
+3. **Verify URLs**: Confirm every linked docs URL appears in the current `llms.txt`
+4. **Prefer live**: Use API results and current docs over any stored claims
