+### C. Core API Surface
+
+- **Base URL**: `https://openrouter.ai/api/v1`
+- **Auth**: `Authorization: Bearer $OPENROUTER_API_KEY`
+- **App Attribution**: Include `HTTP-Referer` and `X-Title` headers when appropriate
+- **Key Endpoints**:
+  - Chat completions: `/chat/completions`
+  - Embeddings: `/embeddings`
+  - Model listing: `/models`
+  - Token usage & credits: `/credits`
+  - Generation metadata: `/generations`
+  - Workspaces: `/workspaces`
+  - Guardrails: `/guardrails`
+  - Responses API (Beta): `/beta/responses`
+
+Always verify endpoints against current docs.
