+
+#### `scripts/pull-docs-index.sh`
+```bash
+#!/bin/sh
+# Fetch and cache the OpenRouter docs index
+set -e
+mkdir -p ~/.hermes/skills/openrouter-expert/cache
+curl -sS https://openrouter.ai/docs/llms.txt -o ~/.hermes/skills/openrouter-expert/cache/llms.txt.tmp && \
+  mv ~/.hermes/skills/openrouter-expert/cache/llms.txt.tmp ~/.hermes/skills/openrouter-expert/cache/llms.txt
+```
+Use: Fetch latest `llms.txt` for local diff/inspection.
+
+#### `scripts/check-doc-url.sh`
+```bash
+#!/bin/sh
+# Check if a URL is in the cached docs index
+set -e
+if [ -z "$1" ]; then
+  echo "Usage: $0 <url>" >&2
+  exit 1
+fi
+url="$1"
+cache=~/.hermes/skills/openrouter-expert/cache/llms.txt
+if [ ! -f "$cache" ]; then
+  echo "Cache not found. Run pull-docs-index.sh first." >&2
+  exit 1
+fi
+grep -Fq "$url" "$cache" && exit 0 || exit 1
+```
+Use: `check-doc-url.sh https://openrouter.ai/docs/quickstart.md` returns 0 if valid.
+
